  "body_text": "如果你近期有从有赞或者微店买货的话\n有没有发现在包裹里会夹杂着一个很特别的“挂耳包”\n外观和其他挂耳包都一样 （为了节省卷材）\n但是背面的冲泡提示贴纸可是有差别的哦 （我剽窃了图标，自配了文字）\n当你收到它后，可以随心所欲的冲泡哈，做热饮的话就多给它点时间泡着，如果冷饮的话就最好用冰水去净泡。\n目前我们做了两款拼配（Olive 和 Lucky Draw）的冷泡/热泡包，开始随机赠送。\n请关注小程序，选购哟～",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          如果你近期有从有赞或者微店买货的话\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          有没有发现在包裹里会夹杂着一个很特别的“挂耳包”\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          外观和其他挂耳包都一样 （为了节省卷材）\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          但是背面的冲泡提示贴纸可是有差别的哦 （我剽窃了图标，自配了文字）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7RuETfOPxFbMXtTO2y6GEvoPe7R5jsLYrkP4PJTsE62vgN4aia2DIIN8icfrLlMc1umUCy8oFZDDgEw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          当你收到它后，可以随心所欲的冲泡哈，做热饮的话就多给它点时间泡着，如果冷饮的话就最好用冰水去净泡。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          目前我们做了两款拼配（Olive 和 Lucky Draw）的冷泡/热泡包，开始随机赠送。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          请关注小程序，选购哟～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q8gztY40VA89LGDdb23gg3bT3s8azp51FtLnHJWNg6Gn8Uw1Bib90OF2da4tHsJMYNEkul7icKibic0w/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"height: 261px;width: 261px;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n</div>",
